@title EMC fix-it: a shield fix drawn before and after on the Shields layer in 3D
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The shields fixture: Preview on the pigtail finding, "In 3D" opens the 3D view with the EMC layer and the Shields layer switched on, with the Before / After banner. Nothing changes until Apply. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-shields.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
scroll 360 400 -450
wait 10
click_text "Preview: Shorten the pigtail" #1
wait 10
expect "Clears EMC-05"
click_text "In 3D"
wait 40
expect "Previewing a fix"
expect "Showing the cabinet as it would be"
shot 01-after
check_layout
click_text Before #1
wait 20
expect "Showing the cabinet as it is"
shot 02-before
check_layout
click_text "Cancel" #1
wait 15
expect_not "Previewing a fix"
shot 03-cancelled
check_layout
